FSL
---

This project's container image includes portions of FSL (FMRIB Software Library), developed at FMRIB, University of Oxford, and licensed by Oxford University Innovation Limited. This repository also includes two reference images derived from FSL data.

The bundled FSL software and reference data are subject to the FSL Licence: https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsl/docs/license.html. They are provided for non-commercial use. Redistribution without separate permission requires no financial return, application of the FSL Licence conditions to recipients, and inclusion of all original and amended source code. These conditions apply to recipients of this distribution.

The image includes fsl-flirt, fsl-fnirt, fsl-avwutils and fsl-tbss, together with their FSL dependencies. Package versions are pinned in container/conda-explicit-linux-64.txt. The official FSL conda channel is https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsldownloads/fslconda/public/.

Package source directories are included under /opt/conda/src/. The modified TBSS script is included at /opt/conda/bin/tbss_1_preproc; its slicesdir report is disabled.

The image includes reference data from fsl-data_standard under /opt/conda/data/standard/, including:

  - FMRIB58_FA_1mm.nii.gz
  - FMRIB58_FA-skeleton_1mm.nii.gz
  - Fornix_FMRIB_FA1mm.nii.gz
  - LowerCingulum_1mm.nii.gz

Two derived reference images are included in this repository under container/scripts/ and in the image under /opt/scripts/:

  - FMRIB58_FA_2mm_crop.nii.gz: a resampled and cropped derivative of FMRIB58_FA_1mm.nii.gz, used as the initial target for longitudinal ANTs template construction.
  - delta-svd_skeletonmask_v1.nii.gz: a masked subset of FMRIB58_FA-skeleton_1mm.nii.gz on the same 1mm grid, restricting analysis to the selected tracts.

