ANTs
----

The container image includes ANTs 2.4.3 (Advanced Normalization Tools, https://github.com/ANTsX/ANTs), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is included at /opt/third-party-licenses/ANTs-LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt.

Two scripts are modified and carry in-file change notices: ANTSpexec.sh has killme.sh invocations disabled; antsMultivariateTemplateConstruction2.sh uses GC instead of MI for linear registration stages.

